<title>USA: Richard Edelman named president, CEO of PR firm.</title>
<headline>Richard Edelman named president, CEO of PR firm.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Edelman Public Relations Worldwide said Friday that Richard Edelman, president and co-chief executive officer, will become chief executive officer and president, effective October. 1.</p>
<p>He will continue to operate out of the New York office, co-headquarters of the 44-year-old company.</p>
<p>Daniel Edelman, who started the company that generates $100 million in annual fee income, will continue as chairman of the parent company, Daniel J. Edelman Inc.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
